# Copy to pyserver/.env (gitignored) before running.
#
# The sidecar runs key-free out of the box: Yahoo Finance (yfinance) is the
# primary source and Stooq is the automatic fallback. The keys below are
# OPTIONAL and only enable extra fallback providers when present.

# Optional: realtime quotes via Finnhub — https://finnhub.io/register
# FINNHUB_API_KEY=your-finnhub-key-here

# Optional: fundamentals/quote fallback via Alpha Vantage —
# https://www.alphavantage.co/support/#api-key
# ALPHAVANTAGE_API_KEY=your-alphavantage-key-here
